Package: @PKG_NAME@
Version: @VERSION@
Section: xfce
Priority: optional
Architecture: @ARCH@
Depends: libgtk-3-0 (>= 3.24), libglib2.0-0, libxfce4panel-2.0-4 | libxfce4panel-2.0-2, libxfce4util7, libxfconf-0-3, xfce4-panel
Maintainer: MS_TAURUS <ms_taurus@mali.ru>
Homepage: https://github.com/MSTAURUS/NiceCalendar
Description: NiceCalendar - clock with a calendar popup for the Xfce panel
 NiceCalendar is an internal Xfce panel plugin (Vala/GTK3) that shows a clock
 with a Windows 10 style calendar popup: month grid, today highlighting and
 quick navigation between months.
 .
 The plugin ships translations for English and Russian.
